.TH BLUEDRAGON-GUI 1 "October 2026" "bluedragon 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bluedragon\-gui \- GTK settings window for the M711 gaming mouse
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bluedragon\-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
Graphical front end to \fBbluedragon\fR(1). The GENERAL tab edits button actions and the
polling rate, DPI edits the five DPI stages, LIGHT edits the LED, and INFO shows the device
and measures the real report rate. Choose a profile at the bottom, edit, then press APPLY.
SET ACTIVE makes the selected profile the one the mouse uses.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bluedragon (1)
